            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Garments (10) for applying TTFields are disclosed, and a method for use in fitting a garment (10), comprising: applying a support layer (14) of a garment (10) to a patient so as to cover a treatment area; applying at least one transducer array (30; 30a-n) to the patient such that the at least one transducer array (30; 30a-n) is attached to the patient; and applying force to the support layer (14) sufficient to remove the support layer (14) from the patient and disconnect the support layer (14) from the at least one transducer array (30; 30a-n).</p>
            </abstract>
